    Automorphism α of D_∞.
    Defined by: α(a^k) = a^-k,  α(a^k b) = a^(1-k) b
    """
    if x.j == 0:
        return D_inf_element(-x.k, 0)
    else:
        return D_inf_element(1 - x.k, 1)

